  "title": "City experience search"
 },
 "description": "Use this when the user asks for bookable experiences by keyword or topic in a city. Returns a ranked search of bookable experience rows. The topic argument is accepted but does no filtering, so every topic returns the same city ranking. The payload contains no tips text or logistics guidance.",
